pmc:TranserfingProtectiveEnergyShieldCh11 a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Protective energy shield"@en, "Energetischer Schutzschild"@de ;
    skos:definition "Uniting the two currents in a sphere is said to form a protective shield around the body, made stable by extending the body's surface energy into it; it guards one's energy from being undermined."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state or ability the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Transerfing ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TranserfingStupen3 ;
    dcterms:source "Vadim Zeland, Transerfing real'nosti, Stupen' III: Vpered v proshloe! (2004), ch. XI Energy, section 'The Protective Shield'; read in the English translation of the combined edition, Reality Transurfing: steps 1-5 (OJSC Ves Publishing Group, 2012), translator not named, which carries no page numbers" .

pmc:TranserfingFountainExerciseYieldsShieldCh11 a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Fountain exercise yields shield"@en, "Fontänenübung bewirkt Schutzschild"@de ;
    skos:definition "The fountain and sphere exercise is said to create and stabilise a protective shield."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:TranserfingEnergyFountainsAndProtectiveSphereCh11 ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:TranserfingProtectiveEnergyShieldCh11 ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Transerfing ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TranserfingStupen3 ;
