pmc:TranserfingCleansedSubtleMeridiansAndSelfRestoredCirculationCh11 a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Cleansed subtle meridians and self-restored circulation"@en, "Gereinigte feine Meridiane und selbst wiederhergestellter Energiefluss"@de ;
    skos:definition "Training is said to clear the subtle meridians: blocks dissolve and aura holes that leak energy close, so one can restore healthy circulation without psychics or reflexologists."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state or ability the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Transerfing ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TranserfingStupen3 ;
    dcterms:source "Vadim Zeland, Transerfing real'nosti, Stupen' III: Vpered v proshloe! (2004), ch. XI Energy, section 'The Protective Shield'; read in the English translation of the combined edition, Reality Transurfing: steps 1-5 (OJSC Ves Publishing Group, 2012), translator not named, which carries no page numbers" .

pmc:TranserfingFountainExerciseYieldsCleansedMeridiansCh11 a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Fountain exercise yields cleansed meridians"@en, "Fontänenübung bewirkt gereinigte Meridiane"@de ;
    skos:definition "Energy training via the fountains is said to cleanse the subtle meridians, gradually."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:TranserfingEnergyFountainsAndProtectiveSphereCh11 ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:TranserfingCleansedSubtleMeridiansAndSelfRestoredCirculationCh11 ;
