pmc:TranserfingNoInstantResultFromEnergyTrainingCh11 a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "No instant result from energy training"@en, "Kein sofortiges Ergebnis durch Energietraining"@de ;
    skos:definition "The cleansing is gradual; nothing happens at once, so absence of immediate change is expected."@en ;
    skos:note "Condition of failure: The cleansing is gradual; nothing happens at once, so absence of immediate change is expected; it bears on pmp:TranserfingEnergyFountainsAndProtectiveSphereCh11."@en ;
