pmc:TranserfingTheEnergyBodyAloneDoesNotStopPendulumsCh11 a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "The energy body alone does not stop pendulums"@en, "Der Energiekörper allein hält Pendel nicht ab"@de ;
    skos:definition "The energy body by itself gives no protection from vampires and pendulums, as they adjust to your frequency, so when a pendulum hooks in and balance wobbles you must wake up and lower importance, then muscles relax, balance returns and the pendulum swings into emptiness."@en ;
    skos:note "Pendulum: pmc:TranserfingMayatnik."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:TranserfingProtectiveEnergyShieldCh11 ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Transerfing ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TranserfingStupen3 ;
    dcterms:source "Vadim Zeland, Transerfing real'nosti, Stupen' III: Vpered v proshloe! (2004), ch. XI Energy, section 'The Protective Shield'; read in the English translation of the combined edition, Reality Transurfing: steps 1-5 (OJSC Ves Publishing Group, 2012), translator not named, which carries no page numbers" .

pmc:TranserfingConsciousAwarenessBeforeControlInMomentsOfImbalanceCh11 a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Conscious awareness before control in moments of imbalance"@en, "Bewusste Wachheit vor Kontrolle in Momenten des Ungleichgewichts"@de ;
    skos:definition "Conscious awareness is called essential for gaining control when inner balance is involuntarily lost; no further consequence stated."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmp:TranserfingRelievingStressByLoweringImportanceCh11 ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:TranserfingConstantAwareness ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:prescribedOrder ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Transerfing ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:TranserfingStupen3 ;
